rtunities More Link #2 Read More December 11, 2025 Bringing families into Gallaudet’s fold More Link #3 Read More May 8, 2025 Record number of honors capstone projects hone students’ creativity and research skills More Link #4 Read More Departments Office of the Registrar Explore Gallaudet University's Registrar's Office for essential academic resources, course registration, and student services designed to support your educational journey. Office for Career Success Discover resources, tips, and support for career success at Gallaudet University. Empower your professional journey with our comprehensive guidance and services. University Library Explore Gallaudet University's Library, a hub for resources, research, and community support designed to empower students and faculty in their academic pursuits. Archives Explore Gallaudet University's Archives, a treasure trove of history and resources dedicated to the deaf community. Discover our collections and research opportunities. Education Abroad and International Fellowships Explore Gallaudet University's Education Abroad and International Fellowships, offering unique opportunities for students to expand their global perspective and experiences. Student Success Discover resources and support at Gallaudet University designed to enhance student success, including academic guidance, career services, and personal development. Meet the Team Robert Sanchez Dean, Academic and Career Success Jerri Dorminy Director, Student Success Felicia Davis Senior Administrative Assistant Elice Patterson Registrar Amy Malm Associate Dean, University Library and Archives Fiona Grugan Education Abroad Manager Contact Academic & Career Success JSAC  | 1225 deanofacademic.careersuccess@gallaudet.edu 202.448-7036 202-448-7036 Monday 7:00 am-4:00 pm Tuesday 7:00 am-4:00 pm Wednesday 7:00 am-4:00 pm Thursday 7:00 am-4:00 pm Friday 7:00 am-4:00 pm Robert Sanchez Dean, Academic and Career Success Overview News Departments Programs Meet the Team In